WEBVTT

00:00.810 --> 00:01.980
<b>Protect Otaku</b>

00:18.780 --> 00:22.070
You gotta pull the trigger like this, right?

00:22.070 --> 00:23.580
That's dangerous, man!

00:24.550 --> 00:26.340
Up, up, down, down...

00:26.340 --> 00:29.350
I put in the invincibility 
code, so I should be safe.

00:30.090 --> 00:31.920
Ah! I can't believe it!

00:31.920 --> 00:32.880
What's wrong?

00:32.880 --> 00:34.630
The overnight special express Ethiopia is

00:34.630 --> 00:36.730
supposed to be passing 
through Tokyo right now!

00:34.880 --> 00:36.720
Special
Express
Ethiopia

00:36.720 --> 00:37.920
Who the hell cares?!

00:37.920 --> 00:39.900
This isn't happening!

00:39.900 --> 00:40.860
Hold it in!

00:40.860 --> 00:43.360
Swallow it! Swallow it!

00:41.850 --> 00:45.090
We've arrived. I'm opening the hatch.

00:51.900 --> 00:56.190
Hey there, Otaku Hero! 
Want me to cast a bravery spell?

00:57.220 --> 00:59.990
I wish you had asked sooner.

01:04.240 --> 01:06.470
Let's start the operation 
and try not to die.

01:06.470 --> 01:07.400
Follow me!

01:07.400 --> 01:08.770
I can't let you do that.

01:09.820 --> 01:11.310
The first to go

01:11.730 --> 01:13.800
has got to be me!

01:14.800 --> 01:18.020
First train departing!

01:16.730 --> 01:18.020
Anarchy-chan!

01:18.020 --> 01:20.720
Your parachute! Parachute!

01:20.960 --> 01:23.560
Here I go. Transform!

01:29.480 --> 01:32.480
<b>2008</b>

01:38.990 --> 01:42.720
If I don't hurry, 
they're gonna sell out

01:42.720 --> 01:45.360
of the limited first run edition!

01:45.360 --> 01:46.240
Huh?

01:46.250 --> 01:48.250
<b>Anime
Game</b>

01:48.420 --> 01:50.750
Some kind of event?

01:51.410 --> 01:54.260
Ah, excuse me! Huh?

01:54.260 --> 01:55.260
<b>New
Releases</b>

01:55.260 --> 01:56.260
<b>Action</b>

01:55.260 --> 01:56.260
<b>Simulation</b>

01:55.260 --> 01:56.260
<b>Shooting</b>

01:56.260 --> 01:59.010
<b>Popular!!!</b>

01:56.260 --> 01:59.010
<b>Newest Releases</b>

01:59.020 --> 02:01.010
What's going on?

02:01.010 --> 02:03.340
Oh! There's one left!

02:01.850 --> 02:03.350
<b>Limited First Run Edition!!
Includes Bonus Materials</b>

02:03.350 --> 02:07.860
Whoa! You're mine, first run edition!

02:14.860 --> 02:16.150
Retrieval complete.

02:19.920 --> 02:21.900
All right. On to the next one.

02:23.960 --> 02:25.800
What the hell are you doing?

02:26.300 --> 02:29.340
Give that back... to me!

02:30.260 --> 02:31.340
Let go.

02:31.590 --> 02:34.720
If you continue to protest, 
I'll take you into protection.

02:35.120 --> 02:36.320
Protection?

02:42.660 --> 02:43.980
Let go!

02:43.980 --> 02:47.930
That's the legendary kabe 
circle issue! Give it back!

02:47.930 --> 02:49.920
I spent three years searching for that!

02:49.920 --> 02:51.650
And it's mint!

02:52.080 --> 02:54.100
Now that's an unusual vehicle!

02:59.200 --> 03:00.610
What a pleasant sound.

03:00.610 --> 03:04.330
Hey! Divine Lariat!

03:05.510 --> 03:07.960
Trying to give me an uninvited clothesline?

03:07.960 --> 03:10.180
How very rude of you!

03:16.320 --> 03:18.720
Your bark is worse than your bite.

03:18.720 --> 03:22.000
Wh-Who the hell are you?

03:22.380 --> 03:24.220
Ah, that smells nice.

03:25.360 --> 03:29.110
What gives trash like you 
the right to smell me?!

03:29.730 --> 03:33.240
How are you?!

03:36.980 --> 03:38.980
General Fan

03:47.240 --> 03:48.870
Today's Weather

03:47.240 --> 03:48.870
Tokyo

03:47.240 --> 03:48.870
Saitama

03:53.160 --> 03:55.500
<i>It began without any warning.</i>

04:04.760 --> 04:06.760
<b>Nakano, Tokyo</b>

04:06.770 --> 04:10.530
<i>People known as otaku, 
regardless of preferred genre,</i>

04:10.530 --> 04:12.520
<b>Nipponbashi, Osaka</b>

04:12.520 --> 04:15.020
<b>Figurines, Hobbies
Ota-Road Main Store</b>

04:12.530 --> 04:15.520
<i>became targets of 
the government's "protection" efforts.</i>

04:13.100 --> 04:15.520
New Bldg. #2

04:22.070 --> 04:24.760
<i>Nobody was able to stop them.</i>

04:25.780 --> 04:28.780
Otaku Protection Rates: 95%

04:25.780 --> 04:28.780
If you see an otaku, contact the SSC.

04:26.280 --> 04:28.790
<i>They said they wanted to protect
a world-famous culture.</i>

04:28.780 --> 04:32.290
Otaku Protection Rates: 95%

04:29.270 --> 04:32.290
<i>For some reason, nobody questioned that.</i>

04:40.300 --> 04:42.820
<i>Otaku disappeared from view.</i>

04:50.810 --> 04:53.820
<i>It only took a single week.</i>

05:05.920 --> 05:10.000
<i>But then, we launched our resistance.</i>

05:13.450 --> 05:16.120
Die
otaku!

05:13.450 --> 05:16.120
Otaku
get out!

05:13.450 --> 05:16.120
Otaku
disappear!

05:13.450 --> 05:16.120
Gross!
Die otaku!

05:13.450 --> 05:16.120
Die otaku!

05:13.620 --> 05:16.120
<b>Present Day, 2011</b>

05:16.120 --> 05:18.710
<b>Pedestrian-Only Zone Ahead</b>

05:29.440 --> 05:30.560
Hey.

05:31.480 --> 05:34.760
We've sucked our food reserves dry. 
That's all we got.

05:34.770 --> 05:36.320
Oh, right.

05:36.600 --> 05:38.600
We'll have to go on another supply run.

05:38.600 --> 05:42.340
Yeah, but I shit bricks every 
time we meet with our supporters.

05:42.340 --> 05:43.950
What're we gonna do?

05:43.950 --> 05:45.110
I'll figure something out.

05:45.320 --> 05:46.510
Something, yeah?

05:46.510 --> 05:47.820
Yeah, something.

05:56.820 --> 05:57.620
Huh?

05:59.920 --> 06:01.380
Whoa!

06:01.380 --> 06:03.390
Whoa!

06:05.410 --> 06:06.380
What?!

06:06.600 --> 06:10.380
Geez, you almost got me pregnant!

06:10.630 --> 06:13.060
Quit messing around, Anarchy-chan.

06:13.060 --> 06:16.160
And I was so looking forward to 
a bizarre plot twist.

06:16.160 --> 06:16.950
Huh?

06:25.340 --> 06:26.570
Damn it!

06:26.570 --> 06:29.310
They never let up, do they?

06:30.200 --> 06:33.200
Sir! A report from the mobile patrol!

06:33.200 --> 06:33.710
All right.

06:35.560 --> 06:37.660
You know, you could just tell me.

06:37.660 --> 06:39.720
He never lets up, either.

06:39.720 --> 06:41.060
So, what does it say?

06:41.060 --> 06:44.420
Another truck full of otaku 
was sent to the protection zone.

06:44.420 --> 06:47.050
Huh? Damn it!

06:47.050 --> 06:49.800
The damn Shobon Army again!

06:50.580 --> 06:52.640
Hey, Otaku Hero.

06:53.230 --> 06:55.630
We've got to find Blue and Pink.

06:56.140 --> 06:59.840
I mean, it's their fault 
that they got lost,

06:59.840 --> 07:02.640
but when the three of us 
magical girls get together,

07:02.640 --> 07:05.400
nothing can ever stop us!

07:05.400 --> 07:08.540
Blue-chan was in the abducted group, too.

07:09.400 --> 07:12.670
That horny, blue, psycho bitch!

07:12.670 --> 07:14.670
It might be time to call it quits.

07:15.660 --> 07:19.300
Quits? What do you mean?

07:19.300 --> 07:21.540
How long since the Shobon goons appeared?

07:21.540 --> 07:22.920
About three years?

07:23.520 --> 07:25.950
We survived the hell of the otaku hunts,

07:25.950 --> 07:30.420
and then otaku from around the country 
gathered to light the flames of revolution.

07:30.420 --> 07:32.280
We made it this far thanks to all of you.

07:32.280 --> 07:34.340
No! It was all thanks to you!

07:34.340 --> 07:37.540
There's no way we could've 
fought back without you!

07:37.540 --> 07:40.490
This is a liberated zone now!

07:40.810 --> 07:41.530
Yeah.

07:41.870 --> 07:45.280
You all worked hard to retake Akiba.

07:45.580 --> 07:49.480
But our fighting power shrinks by the day.

07:49.480 --> 07:51.920
We even have to steal 
weapons from the enemy.

07:52.440 --> 07:56.620
The supporters who bring us food 
have to walk a very dangerous line.

07:57.680 --> 07:58.620
So I think—

07:58.620 --> 08:00.860
So you think? You think what?

08:00.860 --> 08:04.460
If you're gonna act this pathetic, 
why don't I take the leader's chair from you!?

08:05.860 --> 08:08.170
Why not? Give it a shot.

08:08.170 --> 08:08.960
Huh?!

08:08.960 --> 08:09.930
You're passing it to her?

08:10.470 --> 08:11.930
I've had enough.

08:14.420 --> 08:17.190
Wait! Otaku Hero!

08:17.190 --> 08:19.070
Don't you dare wuss out on me!

08:19.070 --> 08:20.800
Give it up, Anarchy-chan.

08:20.800 --> 08:21.800
Huh?

08:22.020 --> 08:26.820
We did basically rely on him for everything.

08:27.140 --> 08:28.320
Am I wrong?

08:29.320 --> 08:33.970
Even the flames of revolution need to 
be fueled, or else they may be extinguished.

08:33.970 --> 08:36.330
You might be right, but still...

08:37.180 --> 08:38.580
Still...

09:05.850 --> 09:07.960
Like a damn chimney.

09:14.960 --> 09:16.240
Did you mean it?

09:16.860 --> 09:19.000
Did you really mean 
you'll quit being leader?

09:20.600 --> 09:23.260
Things are only gonna go downhill from here.

09:23.260 --> 09:27.000
Well yeah, and that's 
why we need to rescue Blue!

09:27.000 --> 09:29.580
Go for it, Anarchy-chan. 
You're the leader, right?

09:29.580 --> 09:31.440
That's not what I'm saying!

09:31.440 --> 09:34.130
With me, Blue, and Pink...

09:34.450 --> 09:37.390
With us magical girls 
and you together, we can fight!

09:37.390 --> 09:41.770
We can make the world a place where 
you can like whatever you want to like again!

09:41.770 --> 09:45.400
You were the leader 
who was supposed to take us there,

09:45.400 --> 09:46.770
Otaku Hero!

09:46.980 --> 09:48.270
It just isn't my thing.

09:48.270 --> 09:49.220
Huh?

09:49.220 --> 09:53.530
Leave that stuff to the guys 
who can or want to do it.

09:53.880 --> 09:55.420
Isn't it the same in anime?

09:55.820 --> 09:59.380
The leaders and heroes either 
are ready to kick ass from the start,

09:59.380 --> 10:02.920
or they say they "don't want to fight" 
and still kick ass anyway.

10:03.500 --> 10:07.000
And you're saying you're neither type?

10:09.300 --> 10:10.100
Hello?

10:10.100 --> 10:11.910
<i>Turn on the TV! Right now!</i>

10:12.350 --> 10:13.180
Here.

10:13.170 --> 10:15.420
<b>New Segment! Celebrities who Smoke!</b>

10:13.170 --> 10:15.420
<b>Emergency Alert</b>

10:13.180 --> 10:15.420
<i>We couldn't make it happen!</i>

10:13.960 --> 10:18.930
"The government has announced 
a major protection action

10:18.930 --> 10:23.330
targeted at key areas of the Chiyoda 
and Taito wards for tomorrow"?!

10:25.310 --> 10:26.500
So you're sure?

10:26.940 --> 10:28.730
Then I'll become leader.

10:28.740 --> 10:31.060
But no takebacks or redos later on, okay?

10:32.350 --> 10:33.200
Yeah.

10:35.240 --> 10:36.340
Fine.

10:39.130 --> 10:41.410
Listen up, creeps!

10:41.410 --> 10:44.160
In preparation 
for the expected enemy action,

10:44.160 --> 10:48.970
the Akiba Liberated Zone 
is now going on 24-hour battle alert!

10:48.970 --> 10:52.110
And I, Anarchy-chan, am taking command!

10:53.460 --> 10:55.420
Yeah!

10:55.420 --> 10:57.670
Open the armory!

11:00.680 --> 11:02.660
A Unit, gather at Suehirocho.

11:02.660 --> 11:04.820
Hey, hey! Get moving, B Unit!

11:04.820 --> 11:06.320
Hurry up, hurry up!

11:25.620 --> 11:27.870
<b>O
T
OTAKU
K
U</b>

11:27.870 --> 11:30.080
Yay!

11:41.960 --> 11:45.300
Akihabara successfully recaptured!

11:46.620 --> 11:48.600
Yeah!

11:48.600 --> 11:50.050
Woo-hoo!

11:50.060 --> 11:52.020
<b>O
T
OTAKU
K
U</b>

11:54.560 --> 11:56.570
<b>Pink Hero
Legend</b>

12:06.450 --> 12:08.830
I'll show you magic tomorrow.

12:09.120 --> 12:10.360
Magic?

12:10.360 --> 12:13.120
My fire magic.

12:13.120 --> 12:16.320
And if that doesn't change your mind,

12:16.320 --> 12:20.840
then I'll become leader 
and bring Blue back myself!

12:33.480 --> 12:36.720
Ah! They're here!

12:41.410 --> 12:45.240
To the designated protected 
individuals occupying this district:

12:45.640 --> 12:48.450
End your resistance 
and surrender immediately!

12:48.450 --> 12:51.800
Just like your comrades, 
we absolutely will not treat you poorly!

12:51.800 --> 12:52.920
Lying pig!

12:52.920 --> 12:57.250
If you refuse, we will use our 
resources to <i>protect</i> you all.

12:59.440 --> 13:00.420
What's this?

13:03.240 --> 13:05.270
If that's how you want it...

13:05.750 --> 13:10.190
All units, follow established policies 
and commence action!

13:10.760 --> 13:13.000
They aren't holding back.

13:13.000 --> 13:14.260
Fire, fire!

13:15.560 --> 13:18.030
Log unit, advance!

13:22.940 --> 13:24.190
<b>Canned Oden</b>

13:24.480 --> 13:25.790
Oh, no!

13:24.480 --> 13:25.790
Watch out!

13:26.800 --> 13:28.850
We won't give up one inch!

13:28.850 --> 13:30.920
We'll never surrender to you!

13:30.920 --> 13:31.840
What's happening up top?

13:31.840 --> 13:33.210
They're making progress.

13:33.210 --> 13:34.220
Where's Anarchy-chan?

13:34.220 --> 13:38.640
I haven't seen her, but everyone's 
following the plan, so we should be okay!

13:46.180 --> 13:49.680
This is a stairway to hell 
when you're out of shape!

13:49.990 --> 13:52.520
You sure are being dramatic about it.

13:52.520 --> 13:53.190
Shut up!

13:53.610 --> 13:56.020
Why do you have to run up anyway?

13:56.020 --> 13:57.720
Where's your transformation bag?

13:57.720 --> 14:01.000
I don't need it. Not now, anyway.

14:03.650 --> 14:07.100
Oh, no! You're gonna have to give u—

14:07.100 --> 14:08.400
The hell?!

14:08.400 --> 14:11.320
I can't let something like this stop me!

14:11.320 --> 14:13.660
So transform, then!

14:14.910 --> 14:18.410
We've made a way through. Charge!

14:18.710 --> 14:20.000
One protected!

14:20.000 --> 14:21.520
Two protected!

14:22.000 --> 14:23.760
And a whole bunch more,

14:23.760 --> 14:25.760
all protected!

14:25.760 --> 14:27.670
The barricade has been breached!

14:27.670 --> 14:30.000
You have to take command, Otaku Hero!

14:30.000 --> 14:31.920
It has to be you!

14:33.010 --> 14:35.560
Why won't you say anything?

14:38.600 --> 14:40.520
Listen up, punks!

14:46.150 --> 14:48.570
Otaku Hero, it's Anarchy-chan!

14:53.080 --> 14:54.540
Up here!

14:56.640 --> 14:59.790
I'll show you what 
Anarchy-chan's magic can do!

14:59.790 --> 15:02.640
Open your eyeballs 
and take a good look!

15:02.640 --> 15:06.040
You impotent, rotten dick 
cheese sons of bitches!

15:07.130 --> 15:08.670
It's a magical girl.

15:08.670 --> 15:11.680
Incendiary rounds! Fire!

15:13.170 --> 15:14.400
Think you can hit me?

15:14.400 --> 15:16.180
They're trying to kill us!

15:16.350 --> 15:19.180
RIP me!

15:19.590 --> 15:21.760
RIP what? You're so full of it.

15:21.760 --> 15:22.850
Oh, you caught me?

15:22.850 --> 15:23.680
Watch out!

15:28.440 --> 15:34.740
<b>O
T
OTAKU
K
U</b>

15:32.540 --> 15:33.280
That's the...

15:33.280 --> 15:34.730
...flag of our revolution!

15:34.730 --> 15:35.540
It represents...

15:35.540 --> 15:36.920
...the dreams of all otaku!

15:37.910 --> 15:40.460
Remember, Otaku Hero!

15:40.460 --> 15:42.960
You wanted to protect what you love.

15:42.960 --> 15:47.240
That urge, that drive, that fire—!

15:53.410 --> 15:55.190
Otaku Hero!

15:57.910 --> 15:59.260
Do you see it?

15:59.510 --> 16:04.030
This means... I'm the leader now.

16:04.030 --> 16:05.970
Got a problem with that?

16:10.680 --> 16:14.670
I'm the leader now! I am!

16:15.210 --> 16:19.680
I wanted everyone to know... but...

16:21.040 --> 16:27.300
the only leader I really want 
is you, Otaku Hero!

16:29.870 --> 16:32.800
Quit crying, Anarchy-chan.

16:33.070 --> 16:35.030
Your spell worked on me.

16:35.030 --> 16:39.790
Your magic set my heart 
on fire, Anarchy-chan.

16:43.060 --> 16:44.560
Here, take this.

16:44.560 --> 16:46.720
You left it behind on purpose, right?

16:47.310 --> 16:50.080
Oh. Yeah!

16:50.080 --> 16:52.500
By the way, how did you get up here?

16:52.500 --> 16:53.520
In that!

16:56.200 --> 16:57.580
A blimp?!

17:12.900 --> 17:14.330
Listen up, everyone!

17:14.330 --> 17:16.560
We're gonna use this thing 
to annihilate the enemy.

17:16.560 --> 17:18.850
And then we're gonna rescue Blue!

17:18.850 --> 17:20.690
I'm the leader of the revolutionary army!

17:20.690 --> 17:21.880
Otaku Hero!

17:21.880 --> 17:23.350
Got a problem with that?

17:23.350 --> 17:25.110
Ooh!

17:23.350 --> 17:25.110
No objection!

17:31.320 --> 17:35.490
They call this a "natural protection zone" 
where otaku can fulfill their otaku desires,

17:35.490 --> 17:37.560
but it's actually just a jail.

17:37.560 --> 17:39.330
No, a fortress.

17:39.330 --> 17:42.110
They have jail cells lined up 
in a wide-open exhibition space.

17:42.110 --> 17:44.240
And the watchtower guarding it all is

17:44.700 --> 17:46.240
Tokyo Big Sight!

17:46.240 --> 17:48.460
Let's start the operation 
and try not to die.

17:48.460 --> 17:49.430
Follow me!

17:49.430 --> 17:50.810
I can't let you do that.

17:51.820 --> 17:53.570
The first to go

17:53.570 --> 17:56.050
has got to be me!

17:57.080 --> 17:59.920
First train departing!

17:58.470 --> 17:59.920
Anarchy-chan!

17:59.920 --> 18:02.720
Your parachute! Parachute!!

18:03.080 --> 18:05.310
Thank you, Otaku Hero.

18:05.610 --> 18:07.680
Here I go. Transform!

18:36.170 --> 18:38.510
Here to destroy both chaos and order,

18:38.920 --> 18:40.720
Magical Girl Anarchy!

18:41.100 --> 18:42.920
If you act naughty,

18:42.920 --> 18:44.470
I'll blow you to bits!

18:49.040 --> 18:51.770
Heaven's Inferno!

18:49.310 --> 18:51.770
<b>Heaven's Inferno</b>

18:52.020 --> 18:53.690
<b>O
T
OTAKU
K
U</b>

18:54.580 --> 18:56.770
Anarchy-chan, set it on fire!

18:56.770 --> 18:57.990
Okay!

18:58.620 --> 19:01.780
Heaven's Paradise!

19:04.600 --> 19:05.700
What?!

19:10.460 --> 19:12.390
What? Wait! Cut it out!

19:18.970 --> 19:20.310
Good job!

19:22.220 --> 19:23.880
Get them!

19:23.890 --> 19:25.640
We did it!

19:27.380 --> 19:29.200
Where's Blue at?

19:29.200 --> 19:31.490
That horny, blue, psycho bitch?

19:32.270 --> 19:33.290
What's that?

19:32.270 --> 19:33.610
<b>Blue Is Here</b>

19:33.670 --> 19:34.730
She's in there!

19:36.400 --> 19:37.240
Watch out!

19:38.520 --> 19:40.610
I got this!

19:40.610 --> 19:41.820
Fire! Fire!

19:44.830 --> 19:47.660
No Hit, No Life!

19:46.450 --> 19:48.330
<b>No Hit, No Life!!</b>

19:50.410 --> 19:51.900
She's murdering!

19:51.900 --> 19:53.750
That's our Anarchy-chan!

19:59.910 --> 20:00.980
Is that...

20:01.480 --> 20:02.760
Blue-chan!

20:04.520 --> 20:05.860
We came to save you!

20:10.150 --> 20:11.080
What the hell is that?!

20:11.080 --> 20:13.640
This time we're all definitely dead!

20:16.500 --> 20:17.680
Anarchy-chan!

20:24.490 --> 20:25.960
Anarchy!

20:24.490 --> 20:25.960
Anarchy-chan!

20:35.460 --> 20:37.770
Anarchy-chan!

20:40.820 --> 20:43.310
He done? My turn, then.

21:04.440 --> 21:05.730
Blue-chan!

21:05.730 --> 21:07.170
Blue-chan!

21:12.580 --> 21:16.270
Otaku Hero-sama?!

21:16.270 --> 21:17.670
